# --- The temple's statues: SMK public-domain scans (SourceArt/Statues/SOURCES.md), 2026-10-19 ------
# *.stl is not under Git LFS, so ~79 MB of raw scans would land in history as plain objects. They are
# re-downloadable from SMK at the URLs in SOURCES.md, and backed up to E: with the rest of SourceArt.
SourceArt/Statues/**/*.stl
# The FBX that build_statues_blender.py makes from them are intermediates too (~37 MB): the imported
# meshes in Content/Statues are committed, and the script rebuilds the FBX from the scans.
SourceArt/Statues/**/*.fbx
